␀␀␀␀␀{kKêÓ^ôp␀␀p␀␀H␀␀␀modules/fd6545247c85a5ed95b81418ff3722caa12808bf7fc97bf02c7ac35abaef34f2module

defineClass Bubble morph

method initialize Bubble {
  self_createCostume 50 50 (transparent)
  self_fillCircle 25 25 25 (randomColor)
  self_setPosition (self_mouseX) (self_mouseY)
}

defineClass 'Bubble Maker' morph

script 'Bubble' 50 52 {
whenBroadcastReceived 'start'
repeat 40 {
  self_changeScale -0.02
  waitSecs
}
self_delete
}

script 'Bubble' 52 213 {
method initialize Bubble {}
}

script 'Bubble' 266 50 {
whenBroadcastReceived 'clear'
self_delete
}

script 'Bubble Maker' 50 57 {
whenBroadcastReceived 'go'
broadcast 'clear'
while true {
  send 'start' (self_instantiate 'Bubble')
  waitSecs 0.01
}
}

