␀␀␀␀␀|gsKýÇåö"␀␀"␀␀H␀␀␀modules/777060256a93394aa8cc3aaaa330839db5e8c4cc9ea0cc5dce425fb1712448f2module

defineClass Brush morph

script 'Brush' 50 50 {
whenBroadcastReceived 'go'
self_hide
animate {
  self_setPenSize 10
  self_setPenColor (colorSwatch 35 190 30 255)
  if (handIsDown) {
    self_penDown
  } else {
    self_penUp
  }
  self_setPosition (self_mouseX) (self_mouseY)
}
}

