␀␀␀␀␀ïƒêJÙ¯I5␀␀5␀␀H␀␀␀modules/eb176c10ce39aa01e674a57e2b6aa8f594e082e0fdfa740e9260be9ce4e677f8module

defineClass Negate morph n

script 'Negate' 55 50 {
whenKeyPressed 'space'
self_copycostume 'JohnMugShot-square'
}

script 'Negate' 51 134 {
whenBroadcastReceived 'go'
for px (self_getPixels) {
  setRed px (255 - (getRed px))
  setGreen px (255 - (getGreen px))
  setBlue px (255 - (getBlue px))
}
}

